  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.36 with immutable ProGPU preview.42 and its native SIMD pixel conversion; adds typed native activation for nonactivating windows and deterministic popup-local diagnostics through the real native input path; fixes X11 transparent visuals and transient popup placement; ships bounded weak render-resource caches, retained-scene disposal, static-frame render suppression, and typed memory ownership diagnostics; consumes the reflection-free media drawing-state bridge; and retains the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
